      "description": "A 44px labelled icon button: close, back, settings, MIDI.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-round\" aria-label=\"Settings\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M12 2v3M12 19v3M4.2 4.2l2.1 2.1M17.7 17.7l2.1 2.1M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.2 19.8l2.1-2.1M17.7 6.3l2.1-2.1\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-round{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:2px solid var(--border,#6D4D37);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--card,#FFFCF7);color:var(--foreground,#3F2816);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)}.ds-btn-round:hover{background:var(--muted,#F3EADB)}.ds-btn-round:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring,#0F68A2);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
