      "description": "The signature: paper keys on a wooden rail; marks pale at rest, full paint when down, a plain key down sky.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-kb\"><div class=\"ds-rail\"></div><div class=\"ds-keys\"><span class=\"w root\">1</span><span class=\"w\"></span><span class=\"w third down\">3</span><span class=\"w\"></span><span class=\"w fifth\">5</span><span class=\"w\"></span><span class=\"w\"></span><i style=\"left:9%\"></i><i style=\"left:23%\"></i><i style=\"left:52%\"></i><i style=\"left:66%\"></i><i style=\"left:80%\"></i></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-kb{width:336px}.ds-rail{height:28px;background:var(--key-rail,#6A4630);border-radius:9px 9px 0 0}.ds-keys{position:relative;display:flex;height:150px;background:var(--key-bed,#A88C77)}.ds-keys .w{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;padding-bottom:10px;margin-right:1px;border-radius:0 0 9px 9px;background:var(--key-white,#FFFCF7);color:var(--on-key-white,#3F2816);font:700 14px 'Onest Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;transition:transform 80ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)}.ds-keys .w:hover{filter:brightness(.95)}.ds-keys .root{background:var(--role-root-wash,#F6C8BE)}.ds-keys .fifth{background:var(--role-5th-wash,#C3DDBA)}.ds-keys .third.down{background:var(--role-3rd,#5FA5DE);transform:translateY(2px)}.ds-keys i{position:absolute;top:0;width:8.5%;height:62%;background:var(--key-black,#362820);border-radius:0 0 6px 6px}"
    }
